 "lane_notes": "PETG-GF structural lane on the 0.6 mm high-flow nozzle. Reuses the exact hash-pinned saved TINMORRY user preset from the 0.4 lane: its Generic PETG-CF @BBL P2S base declares compatibility with the 0.4, 0.6 and 0.8 P2S machines, and the preset already carries Direct Drive Standard / High Flow extruder-variant columns, so one saved preset serves both lanes. Wall loops drop 8 -> 6 to keep the structural shell width (6 x 0.62 = 3.72 mm vs the 0.4 lane's ~3.6 mm). The process is rebased onto the release-wide 0.16 mm / 0.20 mm first-layer schedule so this lane shares the 0.4 lane's Z stack and pause table. Retaining-bead acceptance is a nominal first-qualification seed; tighten to observed widths after the first audited run.",
